    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAUNCH BALL</strong> Position your cannon and skillfully launch the ball! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>puzzle lovers</strong> of all levels (even if you're new to <strong>physics games</strong>); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>+27 carefully crafted levels</strong> to challenge your mind and skills;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a <strong>minimalist and pleasing design</strong>, with elegant geometric shapes and soothing colors; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires <strong>patience</strong>, <strong>strategy</strong>, and a <strong>bit of luck</strong> to overcome the toughest stages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feedback sounds only</strong> for a more immersive experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra levels</strong> for highly skilled players looking for an additional challenge; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aspect of the game has been meticulously <strong>created with love and dedication</strong>; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you adjust the cannon and hit the box in every stage? Test your skills and see how far your precision and strategy can take you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAUNCH BALL</strong> Position your cannon and skillfully launch the ball! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>puzzle lovers</strong> of all levels (even if you're new to <strong>physics games</strong>); </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>+27 carefully crafted levels</strong> to challenge your mind and skills;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a <strong>minimalist and pleasing design</strong>, with elegant geometric shapes and soothing colors; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires <strong>patience</strong>, <strong>strategy</strong>, and a <strong>bit of luck</strong> to overcome the toughest stages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feedback sounds only</strong> for a more immersive experience;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra levels</strong> for highly skilled players looking for an additional challenge; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aspect of the game has been meticulously <strong>created with love and dedication</strong>; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you adjust the cannon and hit the box in every stage? Test your skills and see how far your precision and strategy can take you!</p>",
